      "level": 5,
      "name": "5. Double Shot, on the Rocks",
      "description": "Increases the Level of Icy Paws by 3.\nMaximum upgrade level is 15."
    },
    {
      "level": 6,
      "name": "6. Cat's Tail Closing Time",
      "description": "Characters within Signature Mix's radius gain the following effects based on their HP levels:\n· The Incoming Healing Bonus is increased by 30% when HP is at, or lower than, 50%.\n· Elemental Mastery is increased by 200 when HP is above 50%.\n\nAdditionally, Diona's Max HP is increased by 25%. \nRadiance: Stellar Glimmer: Characters within the Signature Mix field deal increased DMG for the following reactions: \nRadiance: Stellar-Conduct: Superconduct, Stellar-Conduct reaction DMG increased by 40%.\nRadiance: Stellar Swirl: Cryo Swirl, Stellar Swirl reaction DMG increased by 40%."
    }
